{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WgTE402_MOEbTQPgWcKlqQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:19.631752+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WgTE402_MOEbTQPgWcKlqQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0TyNOaG7rnKMcZ30FJiaaoCR7GOSrdN5tc9za96maia75wacmU44FoqQgRXBxnzEthNlHyCAM6ZfFqVs4uEIJlaA9BCzexOUBzpA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>欢迎报考中国海洋大学推荐免试研究生！为方便考生提前做好推荐免试申请准备工作，现就我校2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生预报名工作安排通知如下：</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>01</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德优良，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>3.身心健康，符合国家及我校的相关体检要求。</span></p><p><span>4.预计可获得或已经获得所在本科学校推荐免试资格的考生均可报名，暂未确定是否可以获得推荐免试资格的考生可先行报考。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>02</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.思想政治素质和品德考核表。</span></p><p><span>2.本科在读期间成绩单（须加盖学校或学院教务主管部门公章）。</span></p><p><span>3.外语水平证明或外语资格考试成绩单。</span></p><p><span>4.各类获奖证书、已发表论文等其他证明材料。</span></p><p><span>说明：申请人在学校预报名系统提交以上材料电子版。如以上材料在报名期间无法提供，可在系统内上传情况说明，避免错过报名时间。参加复试时，请将缺失材料提交我校各招生单位进行补验。考生须对所提交材料的真实性负责。对提交虚假材料或弄虚作假者，无论何时，一经发现，即取消录取资格或入学资格，并按教育部相关规定严肃处理。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>03</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式及时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7月23日—9月14日</span></strong><span>17点，考生登录“中国海洋大学研究生考生服务平台（https://stuouc.molstone.cn/）”进行报名，每位考生最多可分别填报三个不同志愿，首次登录需实名注册账号，登录账号为注册时使用的身份证号。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>04</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）因上级教育主管部门推免相关文件暂未下达，报名系统中所列的专业信息及相关推免政策可能会有所调整。</span></p><p><span>（二）我校后续将依据上级政策开展推免复试工作。具体时间及相关工作安排请考生随时关注后续通知。考生正式的推免报名申请仍须在教育部规定时间登录教育部推免服务系统，完成填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></p><p><span>（三）未参加我校预报名的推免生，可在教育部全国推免服务系统开通后，登录系统进行报名。我校各招生单位将根据招生计划剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试，具体安排以各招生单位通知为准。</span></p><p><span>（四）本通知内容与上级教育主管部门日后下达文件不一致的，以上级教育主管部门下达的最新文件为准。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JRXiaxp4VwDvUthU28XdwMSWkJ2icQP1asd2p9QglHKCic3efPgWt0U7gcgt2MibQnpJfoNQIW5vjxDYkEQib5QHfyupABdSSAVa9wTkibMl6Hua8/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>中心简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中国海洋大学会计硕士教育项目始于2007年，是全国第二批、山东省首个会计硕士专业学位授权点。</span></p><p><span>2019年，</span><strong><span><span>我校首次通过会计专业学位教育质量认证（A级），并于2024年成功维持最高等级A级认证，是山东省内唯一通过该项认证的高校。</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0R6ODdpRB6NH278hAiaAWfkmJXNAjpl6QCgWDDWg16Ssic0HRZHRqRgib2MFehHBuwVyIiaHJe59NO5TibRaQgP2TKvZiaeAxhEIXjTU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>2023年，我校通过ACCA总部审核评估，</span><strong><span><span>成为山东首家获得ACCA九门课程有条件免试资格的高校</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0Tr9ibMzM3nqp9HHWvmgY2b2fakddRItrMdhlnGibe4s4ia01cuXVnvLZc9nUq3iaRQWHFnzqBDbibIc2rgnEs0oIOgEV53XanYA8Hg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>目前，我校是山东省会计专业学位授权点中，</span><strong><span><span>唯一达成优秀学位论文、优秀教学案例、案例大赛决赛获奖“大满贯”的高校</span></span></strong><span>，也是全国为数不多实现两次“大满贯”的高校之一。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/88ftnfQrJ0R3MDSOMBF81GsQODlJpHtywSmV4uyIWS3WuqxxPCA1m42gaMnD7FHdWKnibr0IaKkJCRTo55s3QWrib7ibbCyOrjnJ7Lic9emk9MM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>中国海洋大学会计硕士教育项目面向区域与社会经济发展需求，着力培养具备优秀职业操守、价值取向与判断能力，系统掌握会计、财务、审计专业知识与方法，并能理解全球化商业环境与财会惯例精髓并加以灵活运用的应用型高级会计人才。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>项目特色</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>科教融合、产学协同、理实一体的教育资源整合模式。</span></span></strong><span>在资金管理、财会职业教育和智能管控等领域的人才培养上，将研究生理论创新能力和实践创新能力的培养融为一体，构筑了内容丰富、开放共享的研究生教育特色资源体系，实现了人才培养、科学研究与社会服务的协同与互动，成为协同创新和协同培养的典范，获得国家级教学成果二等奖和多项省级教学成果一等奖。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0RLwUH7nE3THWXjd972yWdbbCicsY7yqu4deFWxNcDRmZ50jrWXa4M8Kia0HzZQD97b5eEA2ftk9DaofMrd7l6TUq1zuKEKabIMo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>国际先进与本土特色有机结合的应用型高级财会人才培养体系。</span></span></strong><span>将CPA、ACCA、CIMA、CMA等高端职业资格考试课程与自身的优势特色资源有机融合，构筑国际先进的课程体系，从而使人才培养与高端职业资格更为紧密衔接，并开设了与国内、国际资格考试相衔接的“战略案例分析”“管理案例分析”“高级业绩管理”“高级财务管理”等专业课程以及“营运资金管理”“共赢增值表与智能风险评估”“智能财务共享”等特色课程，实现了国际先进与本土特色的有机结合。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>项目优势</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>资金管理特色人才培养和专业智库优势。</span></span></strong><span>本学位点依托中国企业营运资金管理研究中心持续开展资金管理理论创新与实践调查，持续出版《营运资金管理发展报告》系列丛书，持续开发“中国资金管理智库数据平台”，持续主办“中国资金管理智库高峰论坛”，瞄准国家、地方和企业重大需求，积极发挥智库功能，打造资金管理领域的“学术高地”和“权威智库”。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0QIGRDfbW5TdZkphhmZtl4dejycEgfwGklldKNDvrvD0OiaicAKYI2ibh8KJzDbdmj2v2lgqwY9whv0cGB584PO3waUjC5px1oYf4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0QohcfxY6kfykch2zmtQ0NId8T68picWt3GHMc40AMX5NJ3cwNQ2k6qr3bXAT37ia3QiayuUc3FvhxDwOFmnFkE1HGRF0pXWf5qcU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>适应时代变革和国家重大需求的能力优势。</span></span></strong><span>为适应数字经济、人工智能、物联网等新技术、新经济、新模式对会计行业和会计教育带来的机遇和挑战，本学位点与海尔共建了“物联网生态智能会计与风险评估”研究生联合培养基地，联合开发新课程及工业互联网、共赢增值表、智能财务共享、智能风险评估等十多项教学案例，以培养适应智能财会发展的高层次人才；为满足海南自贸区的建设和发展需求，本学位点在中国海洋大学三亚海洋研究生院设置了“自贸业务高级会计师”和“自贸业务高级风险管理师”方向，强化特色专业知识和专业能力的培养，开发特色课程，为培养自贸区建设创新发展所需的高级应用型财会人才提供了先行示范。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0TDR8lu0wWkahTRmTcYxKpicNicNsDe4jicE56b8T99N69RD8XR6s6age6b3s9bujbx5y0RibqO8diblbNRm7jC0Liagr9kjvx8n0Rhk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JRXiaxp4VwDvUthU28XdwMSWkJ2icQP1asd2p9QglHKCic3efPgWt0U7gcgt2MibQnpJfoNQIW5vjxDYkEQib5QHfyupABdSSAVa9wTkibMl6Hua8/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>研究方向</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>方向一：</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>营运资金管理与智能财务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>方向介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>主要研究资金管理创新概念框架、分析体系及智能财务共享、智能司库与金融风险评估等应用系统开发和评价，获国家社科基金重大项目和系列国家级课题资助。我国营运资金管理领域被引率最高的5篇论文占4篇，依托平台入选中国智库索引（CTTI）高校智库百强（A）。科教成果获国家教学成果奖和10多项省部级奖。该方向将为“十强”产业转型和智能财务提供强力支撑。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>导师组长</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>王竹泉</span></strong></p><p><span>教授，中国企业营运资金管理研究中心主任，中国海洋大学管理学院院长，会计硕士教育中心主任。获国家高层次人才支持计划、中宣部文化名家暨四个一批人才工程、财政部会计育名家培养工程、教育部新世纪人才支持计划、财政部全国会计领军人才培养工程特殊支持计划等资助，国务院政府特殊津贴专家。</span></p><p><span>主要研究方向为会计理论，资本效率与财务风险。立足于中国市场经济和企业发展实际需求，开拓了\"资本效率与财务风险\"和\"利益相关者会计与政府社会资本管理\"两个具有鲜明特色的研究领域，并在资本效率与营运资金管理绩效评价、财务风险评估、利益相关者会计信息需求与财务报表列报改革、政府社会资本管理等方面进行了系统深入的研究。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0Q4QPQqqOZeMSRm4tldriadYqkLzy9ACesuUs2uDOqpUwm7ndY3pr8Oqrfft6y1CqIpljb0vTcXJ6ZKiaG5B2dsqNAEMD6ROkVOY/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>方向二：</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>数据资本、公司治理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>方向介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本方向聚焦于数据资本的核心价值，深入研究企业财务与非财务信息的披露、有效支撑企业战略制定、支持关键决策、服务业务运营、驱动价值创造与强化风险防范，获得多项国家级课题资助，研究成果丰硕，在《经济研究》《管理世界》《会计研究》《管理科学学报》、Journal of Corporate Finance 等国内外顶尖学术期刊持续发表。研究成果不仅具有重要的理论创新价值，更对会计在数智化时代更好地发挥决策支持、治理赋能、价值创造与风险防范的核心功能，服务企业高质量、可持续发展提供了坚实的学术支撑和实践指导</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>导师组长</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>贾凡胜</span></strong></p><p><span>教授，管理学院副院长，会计硕士教育中心副主任，山东省泰山学者特聘教授、山东省社科青年人才团队负责人、中国海洋大学青年英才工程第一层次教授。</span></p><p><span>研究方向为制度与公司治理和财务管理，在《经济研究》、《管理世界》、Emerging Markets Review、Pacific-Basin Finance Journal、Regional Studies等国内外权威期刊发表论文20余篇、多次承担与参与国家社科重大、自然科学基金及其他服务企业与政府咨询项目。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0T7yvmRYlmef7RJNZmcUoL06P4G26oC0B2p9rbtzw9LjPcutan2Rl9CmUmUOslP68RCSXJP5iaUC5DIRbsbNSDg2g0gkv47nwhk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>方向三：</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>数字审计与可持续发展</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>方向介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>该方向主要研究信息技术和大数据应用对审计模式的影响及数字审计的演变、 数字审计模式下审计流程和程序的改变、关键实施要素等。同时，该方向将碳资产审计、自然资源审计等与数字审计交叉， 探索审计支持可持续发展的路径和模式，获多项国家级课题资助，成果在《会计研究》《审计研究》等国内外顶尖刊物发表，对推动数字审计转型和可持续发展具有重要支撑。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>导师组长</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>房巧玲</span></strong></p><p><span>教授，会计学系主任，2016年获得财政部颁发的“全国会计领军人才证书”。</span></p><p><span>主要研究方向资源环境审计、数据基础审计、审计市场与审计质量。主持国家自然科学基金项目2项，主持省部级项目、企业横向课题多项， 在《会计研究》、《审计研究》等发表论文数十篇， 出版学术专著1部，获得多项科研奖励和教学奖励。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0Ric7EXIkQNqURWvNAibCyN6FUAKIG3icfpXEcK5jUzwku5E0NzFGkVE6mXkbYmKNlmMoGzPqCovXgsqfn1nkqX73mH2tmbHuIuEk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/88ftnfQrJ0RYXwuq69MNj8EUAib17e9mLPxPice8ticD6whYAicb1UTASK7POpJDw48SksdMmyO8icddjR7lJQIWK3XdbR49gYWJlYukrQqgFfgQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>地址：山东省青岛市崂山区松岭路238号中国海洋大学崂山校区管理学院</span></p></li><li><p><span>电话：0532-85902396</span></p></li><li><p><span>邮箱：mpacc@ouc.edu.cn</span></p></li></ul></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JRXiaxp4VwDvUthU28XdwMSWkJ2icQP1asd2p9QglHKCic3efPgWt0U7gcgt2MibQnpJfoNQIW5vjxDYkEQib5QHfyupABdSSAVa9wTkibMl6Hua8/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><s